<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 18, 2003 :: Two more dragons and Vindi!</div><P>Gathered our forces to do some more dragon hunting today, and Raihn found us Lendiniara the Keeper and Sontalek. First we strolled in and took down Lend, to avoid more folks falling KOS before we headed into ToV. Grats Colwn on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/lendiniarastalisman.jpg">Lendiniara's Talisman</A>, Duktak on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Truesight_Helmet.gif">Truesight Helmet</A> and SG on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/glovesstability.jpg">Gloves of Stability</A>! Ceyria looted several pieces of Kael quest armor as well, nothing earth shattering. </P>
<P><IMG alt="Tryder busted!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lend.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>After Lend, we headed out to not only kill, but utterly decimate Sontalak. Esorpa of the Ring crashed our party and Vorne offtanked that for the short time Sont was alive. Grats Cass on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/sontalaks_talisman.JPG">Sontalak's Talisman</A>! I think Drue took a picture, cause I kinda forgot, as always! </P>
<P>Saragoth led us to Arena in Kael after this, to fix some faction and kill Vindi. Grats Morlith on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/chestplate_of_vindication.jpg">Chestplate of Vindication</A> and Druentia on some head! And I even took a picture before Vindi was reduced to a set of feet!</P>
<H2 style="FONT-SIZE: 22px"><IMG alt="Before he's just feet!!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vindiback.jpg" align=baseline border=0></H2><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 19, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 17, 2003 :: Grats Zavitar and Voragon!</div><P>Two more epics that I have no pictures for (but really, Voragon doesn't want me to take a picture with old models and no effects... who wants to see a blockhead dwarf with a wrench?)! A group of us ran Voragon to get some final peices while Wonderous led Zavitar, Jen, Cerd, Wellish and Sparkley to clear Fear for us. Once they'd cleared a nice chunk, Team Slacker zoned in and helped finish the job. Reide played crazy cowboy and rounded up Amy Temply and Shissar and soon Zavitar got some much needed head! Voragon did his turn in to Irak whatever and got his epic, and Grik got a step closer to his. </P>
<P>Thanks late night crew for coming out and getting a few mobs killed!</P>
<P>Oh yah... and some of us ran over and did the 8th Shawl War for Tempys! Grats to the Greed Roll winners of the loot! </P>
<P>Levels.. I know some more folks made levels. But Wonderbutt wasn't around to keep up with it all! I remember Khyrra making 40! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 16, 2003 :: Feet... more feet!</div><P>More killing of Inny to get some more upgrades and kill the ugly blue bastard! Grat to Lushissx on a shiny new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/dreadscale_cloak.jpg">Dreadscale Cloak </A>and Beryllin and Lairiel both walked away with <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/polished_zraxthril_coif.jpg">Polished Zraxthril Coif</A>! Now for the feet shot!</P>
<P><IMG alt="need Mysch if you don't want feet pics!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/inny4.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 16, 2003 :: Leveling Updates!</div><P>We've had quite a few guildmates level in the past few days!</P>
<P>Congratulation to the following folks!</P>
<UL>
<LI>Thayet on 61st!
<LI>Aridius on 63rd! 
<LI>Morlith 47th! 
<LI>Lumalie on 58th! 
<LI>Ewlala on 53rd! 
<LI>Tearem on 54th! 
<LI>Cimerene on 60th and Crusader! 
<LI>Tryder on 60 and Phantasmist! 
<LI>Zorin on 56th! 
<LI>Zentox on 54th! 
<LI>Mytee on 50th! 
<LI>Shatta on 49th! 
<LI>Sparkley on 59th! 
<LI>Tylokki on 61st! 
<LI>Arwiin on 48!</LI></UL>
<P>&nbsp;Congrulations to everyone! Keep up the awesome work!.</P>
<P>- Wonderous</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Oct 17, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 14, 2003 :: And.. now for something completely different...</div><P>More hedge flagging done. Ran it a bit later to get a few more members who missed out before! Grats Cerdiwan on your Black Bastardsword, Vixxyn on a Twisted Longbow and Sparkley on the greed roll for a Twisted Longbow!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/con1.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 12, 2003 :: Couple of Epics today!</div><P>After many many many hours in Hate, three elusive drops finally appeared! Grats Zavitar and Lumalie on essence, and Thayet on the staff! Zavitar just lacks one drop for his snakedom... but now onto the epic grats!</P>
<P>Lumalie looking sexy with some bite!<BR><IMG alt="Rezz effects maybe gone too!" hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/lumalie_epic_02.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Sexy little gnomer showing off her colors!<BR><IMG alt="Yet another pet, and this time not a necro!" hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/thayet_epic_01.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Some belated and incomplete leveling grats...</P>
<P>Grats Erowyn on 65 and Arch Convoker!<BR>Grats Wonderous on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grats Jenreree on 63!<BR>Grats Aridius on 62!<BR>Grats Thayet on 60 and Arch Mage!<BR>Grats Softeyes on 59!<BR>Grats Juhel on 58!<BR>Grats Tearem on 53!<BR>Grats Valoura on 52!<BR>Grats Wellish on 50!<BR><BR>...will add the others soon!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Lokki on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 10, 2003 :: More Hedge Flagging.. alt night almost!</div><P>Wonderous led us in to get more folks flagged for PoNB, and lots of us dusted off those low level alts to go through. Nice work folks and nice work Tryder on being our only chanter through! And you only went LD once. /laughs</P>
<P>Grats Tryder on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Skull_lined_amice.jpeg">Skull Lined Amice</A>! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=12'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=11'>11</a> <a href='news.asp?page=12'>12</a> 13 <a href='news.asp?page=14'>14</a> <a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a> &nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=14'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=620><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/manaetic_behemoth.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Mar 26</b></a> - Manetic Behemoth and Cap!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
